{"title":"Testimony of Rachel (Farkas) Zadok, born in Volove, Czechoslovakia, 1929, regarding her experiences in Volove, the Sekernice Ghetto, Auschwitz, Stutthof, Thorn and other places","tag":"testimony","url":null,"infoText":"Testimony of Rachel (Farkas) Zadok, born in Volove, Czechoslovakia, 1929, regarding her experiences in Volove, the Sekernice Ghetto, Auschwitz, Stutthof, Thorn and other places&#x0D;\n&#x0D;\nHer childhood in Volove.&#x0D;\n&#x0D;\nHungarian Army occupation [of Volove], 1939; arrival of refugees from Poland; deportation of residents who lack citizenship, 1941; life under Hungarian occupation including anti-Jewish legislation, the confiscation of her father's business and the ban on kosher ritual slaughter; German Army occupation [of Volove], March 1944; deportation to the Sekernice Ghetto; deportation to Auschwitz, approximately one month later; camp life without labor but with roll-calls; transfer to Stutthof, one month later; camp life without labor but including selections; transfer to Thorn; cut off from her ill sister; camp life including hunger and labor in digging; approach of the [military] front; death march; murder of people during the death march; arrival to Praust, approximately 10 days later; life in Danzig including labor digging; hunger and typhus disease; liberation by the Red Army, February 1945.&#x0D;\n&#x0D;\nLife after the war; aliya to Eretz Israel, May 1946.&#x0D;\n&#x0D;\n","hasMedia":true,"youtubeObj":{"GhHKFgl81AU":[]},"moreInfo":null,"images":[],"resources":[{"title":"details","url":null,"urlTitle":null,"type":"details","elements":[{"title":"itemId","value":[{"id":"itemId","value":"8424116","url":null}]},{"title":"firstName","value":[{"id":"firstName","value":"Rachel","url":null}]},{"title":"lastName","value":[{"id":"lastName","value":"Tzadok","url":null},{"id":"lastName","value":"Zadok","url":null}]},{"title":"maidenName","value":[{"id":"maidenName","value":"Farkas","url":null},{"id":"maidenName","value":"Farkash","url":null}]},{"title":"dob","value":[{"id":"dob","value":"16/04/1929","url":null}]},{"title":"pob","value":[{"id":"pob","value":"Volove, Czechoslovakia","url":null}]},{"title":"materialType","value":[{"id":"materialType","value":"Testimony","url":null}]},{"title":"language","value":[{"id":"language","value":"Hebrew","url":null}]},{"title":"recordGroup","value":[{"id":"recordGroup","value":"O.3 - Testimonies Department of the Yad Vashem Archives","url":null}]},{"title":"earliestDate","value":[{"id":"earliestDate","value":"23/12/09","url":null}]},{"title":"latestDate","value":[{"id":"latestDate","value":"23/12/09","url":null}]},{"title":"submitter","value":[{"id":"submitter","value":"Zadok Farkas Rachel","url":null}]},{"title":"original","value":[{"id":"original","value":"YES","url":null}]},{"title":"interviewLocation","value":[{"id":"interviewLocation","value":"ISRAEL","url":null}]},{"title":"belongsTo","value":[{"id":"belongsTo","value":"O.3 - Testimonies gathered by Yad Vashem","url":null}]},{"title":"testimonyForm","value":[{"id":"testimonyForm","value":"Video","url":null}]},{"title":"subjects","value":[{"id":"subject","value":"Persecution of the Jews of Hungary","url":"/en/documents/search-results?page=1&f_subjects_search_en=Persecution of the Jews of Hungary"},{"id":"subject","value":"Deportees from Hungary","url":"/en/documents/search-results?page=1&f_subjects_search_en=Deportees from Hungary"},{"id":"subject","value":"Hungarian collaborators","url":"/en/documents/search-results?page=1&f_subjects_search_en=Hungarian collaborators"},{"id":"subject","value":"Attitude towards the Jews - Ukrainian population","url":"/en/documents/search-results?page=1&f_subjects_search_en=Attitude towards the Jews - Ukrainian population"},{"id":"subject","value":"Deportation from the ghettos","url":"/en/documents/search-results?page=1&f_subjects_search_en=Deportation from the ghettos"},{"id":"subject","value":"Anti-Jewish legislation","url":"/en/documents/search-results?page=1&f_s